WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'll reward you with a drink

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,620
Don't even raise your head yet

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:09,230
Tell you to raise your head, your ears are deaf

4
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:11,370
Do you need me to call someone to help you?

5
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,850
But you look so unappetizing

6
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,650
This is the only way I can reward you with my wine

7
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,010
Take the money and get out

8
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,650
My eyes hurt if I look at you one more time

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:33,410
Come on, bite your tail and I'll help you, Sister Meng.

10
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:34,880
these money

11
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,800
Could you please help me deposit it into my bank card?

12
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:54,270
Becoming more and more self-aware
